OL,3,GNEWSAPupils fascinated by space get
OL,4,Aastronomy lesson
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey primary school children have
OL,7,Fenjoyed learning about space in a
OL,8,Flesson delivered by an astronomer.
OL,10,FDr Robin Catchpole of the Cambridge
OL,11,FInstitute of Astronomy was invited to
OL,12,Fthe island by the Jersey Astronomy Club
OL,13,Fand shared his extensive knowledge with
OL,14,Fpupils aged 10 and 11 at First Tower
OL,15,FSchool.
OL,17,FYear 6 pupil Lola, 11, said her
OL,18,Ffavourite part was learning about how
OL,19,Fthe planets were created while Vihaan,
OL,20,F10, said he was fascinated by black
OL,21,Fholes and how they were formed.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
