OL,3,GNEWSAPupils fascinated by space get
OL,4,Aastronomy lesson
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatchpole, who has written and
OL,7,Fco-written more than 100 research
OL,8,Fpapers and articles on astronomy, said
OL,9,Fhis trick for making space accessible
OL,10,Fto children was to show them planets
OL,11,Fthey would be familiar with.
